---
// "Peace of mind" — two guarantee cards plus a wide service-area card.
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-lav-50/60 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <!-- header -->
    <div class="reveal mb-9 sm:mb-14">
      <span class="ml-[16px] inline-flex items-center rounded-[40px] bg-[#eeeef0] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#0d0f29]">
        Peace of mind
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-1.5 border-l-[3.5px] border-accent pl-[16px] font-display text-[clamp(1.5rem,3.1vw,2.15rem)] font-normal leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#0d0f29]">
        Your clothes,<br />in safe hands.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- cards -->
    <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:flex lg:flex-row lg:items-stretch">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <article class="flex min-h-[230px] flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-[#d6d6ec] p-5 sm:min-h-[300px] sm:p-6 lg:min-h-[320px] lg:w-[260px]">
        <h3 class="text-[13px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[#1b1e55] sm:text-[23px]">Satisfaction guarantee</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium leading-[1.45] text-[#5256a3] sm:text-[14px]">
          If anything comes back less than perfect, we'll re-clean it for free — or
          refund you. Your happiness is the whole point.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <article class="flex min-h-[230px] flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl bg-[#d6d6ec] p-5 sm:min-h-[300px] sm:p-6 lg:min-h-[320px] lg:w-[260px]">
        <h3 class="text-[13px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[#1b1e55] sm:text-[23px]">Fully insured &amp; tracked</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium leading-[1.45] text-[#5256a3] sm:text-[14px]">
          Every order is barcoded, tracked and insured from the moment we collect it
          to the moment it's back in your hands.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 3: service area -->
      <article
        class="relative col-span-2 flex min-h-[320px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#eeeef0] p-6 sm:aspect-[690/422] sm:p-7 lg:flex-1"
        style="background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#e9f2fc 0%,#ffffff 60%)"
      >
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[17px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[#1b1e55] sm:text-[22px] lg:text-[25px]">Now serving your neighborhood</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-[13px] font-medium leading-[1.5] text-[#5256a3] sm:text-[14px]">
            Clean Pro covers 50+ neighborhoods across the city and we're expanding
            every month. Enter your postcode at checkout to see same-day pickup slots.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- service badges -->
        <div class="relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:gap-3">
          <div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-[#fafafa] bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-[0_6px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] sm:gap-3">
            <span class="grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent/10 text-accent">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-5.2-6.5-10A6.5 6.5 0 0 1 18.5 11c0 4.8-6.5 10-6.5 10Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="11" r="2" /></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="text-[13px] font-medium leading-tight text-[#171946] sm:text-[14px]">50+ neighborhoods</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] font-medium text-[#5256a3] sm:text-[12px]">Same-day pickup slots</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-[#fafafa] bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-[0_6px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] sm:gap-3">
            <span class="grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-mint/15 text-navy">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18" /></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="text-[13px] font-medium leading-tight text-[#171946] sm:text-[14px]">Open 7 days a week</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] font-medium text-[#5256a3] sm:text-[12px]">Early &amp; late slots</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
